      "effect": "If a face-up card(s) you control is destroyed by an opponent's card effect: You can toss a coin and call it. If you call it right, Special Summon 1 monster from your GY. If you call it wrong, Set 1 Trap from your GY. If this card in your possession is destroyed by an opponent's card effect: You can activate 1 of these effects;\n\u25cf Special Summon 1 monster from your GY.\n\u25cf Set 1 Trap from your GY.\nYou can only use each effect of \"Just Flip a Coin\" once per turn."
